cff-version: 1.2.0
type: software
title: CodeRefiner
authors:
  - family-names: Ergen
    given-names: Mehmet Sergen
    affiliation: Department of Computer Engineering, Kocaeli University
  - family-names: Sayar
    given-names: Ahmet
    affiliation: Department of Computer Engineering, Kocaeli University
repository-code: https://github.com/msergenergen/coderefiner
license: MIT
description: >-
  A LangGraph pipeline that solves LiveCodeBench problems iteratively using
  LLM-as-a-Judge. A code generator produces solutions, static analysis and
  sandboxed execution provide evidence, and an LLM judge makes the final
  ACCEPT/REJECT decision with feedback for refinement.
keywords:
  - code generation
  - LLM-as-a-Judge
  - iterative refinement
  - code evaluation
version: 1.0.0

